WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:04.561
- Remember that time we ate
12 Pop-Tarts in one sitting?

00:00:04.561 --> 00:00:05.621
It's right now.

00:00:05.621 --> 00:00:06.454
- Oh yeah.

00:00:06.454 --> 00:00:07.287
(laughter)

00:00:07.287 --> 00:00:09.352
(record scratch)

00:00:09.352 --> 00:00:13.519
- Today we're trying Jolly
Rancher-flavored Pop-Tarts!

00:00:14.725 --> 00:00:17.271
- I'm excited to see these
two combos come together,

00:00:17.271 --> 00:00:18.947
Jolly Ranchers and Pop-Tarts.

00:00:18.947 --> 00:00:20.504
- I used to eat the S'mores one,

00:00:20.504 --> 00:00:22.493
the Cinnamon one, the Strawberry one.

00:00:22.493 --> 00:00:23.760
I love all of them.

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:26.211
- As a kid, my teacher used
to throw Jolly Ranchers

00:00:26.211 --> 00:00:29.169
as prizes if you get an answer right.

00:00:29.169 --> 00:00:31.998
- I used to be a avid Pop-Tart eater.

00:00:31.998 --> 00:00:33.870
Like, I was on top of it,

00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:36.746
and the strawberry flavor was my jam.

00:00:36.746 --> 00:00:38.079
No pun intended.

00:00:39.896 --> 00:00:42.630
- I already like the
design of the Pop-Tart.

00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:43.549
It's so '90s.

00:00:43.549 --> 00:00:44.401
- It really is.

00:00:44.401 --> 00:00:47.216
- If Dr. Seuss was made into
a pastry, this would be it.

00:00:47.216 --> 00:00:49.132
- They smell like those
chewable Jolly Ranchers.

00:00:49.132 --> 00:00:49.996
- Yeah.

00:00:49.996 --> 00:00:50.996
Smells good.

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:53.363
- Yeah.

00:00:55.499 --> 00:00:58.297
- It tastes identical to a Jolly
Rancher, like, super sweet.

00:00:58.297 --> 00:01:00.489
- I don't know if the combo works for me.

00:01:00.489 --> 00:01:02.505
- This is every kid's dream.

00:01:02.505 --> 00:01:03.504
- I like it.
- Mhmm.

00:01:03.504 --> 00:01:04.893
I feel like a child eating this,

00:01:04.893 --> 00:01:07.393
and I'm not afraid to
admit that I like it.

00:01:07.393 --> 00:01:10.203
- Green Apple, always a classic.

00:01:10.203 --> 00:01:11.173
Oh my god!

00:01:11.173 --> 00:01:12.709
- Wow, it's strong.

00:01:12.709 --> 00:01:13.542
- It's so strong.

00:01:13.542 --> 00:01:15.304
- [Female Taster] It's
stronger than the Watermelon.

00:01:15.304 --> 00:01:16.995
- All right, let's try it.

00:01:16.995 --> 00:01:18.222
Oh, that's sour.

00:01:18.222 --> 00:01:19.265
Holy shit!

00:01:19.265 --> 00:01:20.323
- Too much flavor.

00:01:20.323 --> 00:01:21.523
I keep scrunching my face.

00:01:21.523 --> 00:01:23.593
- And yet, I wanna take another bite.

00:01:23.593 --> 00:01:25.493
- I have to be in some kind
of mood to wanna have this

00:01:25.493 --> 00:01:27.060
because it's so sour.

00:01:27.060 --> 00:01:28.612
- 10 out of 10!

00:01:28.612 --> 00:01:31.479
I've never tasted a Pop-Tart this good.

00:01:31.479 --> 00:01:33.380
This is exactly like
the green Jolly Rancher.

00:01:33.380 --> 00:01:34.713
This is amazing.

00:01:35.809 --> 00:01:37.543
- [Female Taster] It's
like a Valentine Pop-Tart.

00:01:37.543 --> 00:01:38.958
- I kinda miss the sprinkles,

00:01:38.958 --> 00:01:41.177
like the traditional sprinkles.

00:01:41.177 --> 00:01:42.944
- Out of all the other Pop-Tarts,

00:01:42.944 --> 00:01:45.240
this is the best-designed Pop-Tart.

00:01:45.240 --> 00:01:47.145
- You can't even talk about Jolly Ranchers

00:01:47.145 --> 00:01:49.401
without at least talking about cherry.

00:01:49.401 --> 00:01:50.430
I mean, come on now.

00:01:50.430 --> 00:01:51.763
One, two, three.

00:01:55.392 --> 00:01:56.973
This is gonna be a hard no.

00:01:56.973 --> 00:01:58.269
- It tastes like Valentine's Day.

00:01:58.269 --> 00:02:00.608
I see teddy bears and rose
petals and red balloons.

00:02:00.608 --> 00:02:02.052
- It doesn't taste like medicine.

00:02:02.052 --> 00:02:03.242
- Yeah, it doesn't taste like medicine.

00:02:03.242 --> 00:02:04.146
It doesn't taste fake.

00:02:04.146 --> 00:02:05.476
- This would be good, you know,

00:02:05.476 --> 00:02:06.999
take this on a Valentine's Day breakfast.

00:02:06.999 --> 00:02:08.612
- I think your date would dump you.

00:02:08.612 --> 00:02:10.293
- [Male Taster] The
watermelon took the slice.

00:02:10.293 --> 00:02:11.222
- Yes it did!

00:02:11.222 --> 00:02:12.455
- It was a clear winner today.

00:02:12.455 --> 00:02:13.853
- If you're looking for a deviation

00:02:13.853 --> 00:02:15.134
from the typical fruity Pop-Tarts,

00:02:15.134 --> 00:02:16.864
I'd say that's the one to go to.

00:02:16.864 --> 00:02:19.656
- My favorite one was Cherry
because it had the best ratio

00:02:19.656 --> 00:02:21.886
of the Pop-Tart to the candy,

00:02:21.886 --> 00:02:23.551
and it tasted the least fake to me.

00:02:23.551 --> 00:02:25.402
- Watermelon was by far the best.

00:02:25.402 --> 00:02:28.382
I would eat that at
home, now, as an adult.

00:02:28.382 --> 00:02:31.230
- Honestly, don't try to
make Watermelon a Pop-Tart.

00:02:31.230 --> 00:02:33.743
It was good, but it wasn't great.

00:02:33.743 --> 00:02:35.246
- Bring us Grape.

00:02:35.246 --> 00:02:36.295
- Bring the Grape.

00:02:36.295 --> 00:02:37.475
And maybe Peach.

00:02:37.475 --> 00:02:38.608
- And Lemon.

00:02:38.608 --> 00:02:40.547
- Oh, Lemon would be good, I think.

00:02:40.547 --> 00:02:41.380
That'd be nice.

00:02:41.380 --> 00:02:44.463
(upbeat retro music)

